    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/c2cf7f277977d5589233371c4d2f0275.avif?t=1696435251\" width=296 height=102 /></span><br>Chained bean is action game with little bit of horror element, where your enemy is bouncy ball<br><br>Controlls: A -Move Left, D - Move Right, X - Shoot<br><br>You will explore the hounted house where your brother was lost.<br>You will use your chain to fight enemies.<br>2D action game where your enemy is a ball that bounce off the walls and you need to shoot it with your chain.<br>But when you do that, enemy can split. You need to defeat all of them and save your brother from dephts of haunted house<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/b6b714119c5a4304eb4108a0b5fab4bd.poster.avif?t=1696435251\" width=600 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/b6b714119c5a4304eb4108a0b5fab4bd.webm?t=1696435251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/b6b714119c5a4304eb4108a0b5fab4bd.mp4?t=1696435251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/687b071b853bbaf1a53b6b46a9c34303.avif?t=1696435251\" width=189 height=103 /></span><br><br>It was Halloween night, and the two cucumber siblings, Larry and Laura, were visiting an old mansion. Laura was too scared to go inside, so Larry went in by himself.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/bf52b2c84558a9e6c9a392f457267c33.avif?t=1696435251\" width=590 height=586 /></span><br><br>Larry explored the mansion, but he soon heard a strange voice calling him. He followed the voice, and it led him to a dark room. In the middle of the room was a white, round face with no eyes or mouth, just black holes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/971f96c3db42ef0b771b65673a55d5a8.avif?t=1696435251\" width=582 height=586 /></span><br><br>The face was terrifying, and Larry screamed. &quot;Help me!&quot;. His little sister heard him, and she ran into the mansion to help him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/bf52b2c84558a9e6c9a392f457267c33.avif?t=1696435251\" width=590 height=586 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/c2cf7f277977d5589233371c4d2f0275.avif?t=1696435251\" width=296 height=102 /></span><br>Chained bean is action game with little bit of horror element, where your enemy is bouncy ball<br><br>Controlls: A -Move Left, D - Move Right, X - Shoot<br><br>You will explore the hounted house where your brother was lost.<br>You will use your chain to fight enemies.<br>2D action game where your enemy is a ball that bounce off the walls and you need to shoot it with your chain.<br>But when you do that, enemy can split. You need to defeat all of them and save your brother from dephts of haunted house<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/b6b714119c5a4304eb4108a0b5fab4bd.poster.avif?t=1696435251\" width=600 height=502 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/b6b714119c5a4304eb4108a0b5fab4bd.webm?t=1696435251\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/b6b714119c5a4304eb4108a0b5fab4bd.mp4?t=1696435251\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/687b071b853bbaf1a53b6b46a9c34303.avif?t=1696435251\" width=189 height=103 /></span><br><br>It was Halloween night, and the two cucumber siblings, Larry and Laura, were visiting an old mansion. Laura was too scared to go inside, so Larry went in by himself.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/bf52b2c84558a9e6c9a392f457267c33.avif?t=1696435251\" width=590 height=586 /></span><br><br>Larry explored the mansion, but he soon heard a strange voice calling him. He followed the voice, and it led him to a dark room. In the middle of the room was a white, round face with no eyes or mouth, just black holes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/971f96c3db42ef0b771b65673a55d5a8.avif?t=1696435251\" width=582 height=586 /></span><br><br>The face was terrifying, and Larry screamed. &quot;Help me!&quot;. His little sister heard him, and she ran into the mansion to help him.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2619720/extras/bf52b2c84558a9e6c9a392f457267c33.avif?t=1696435251\" width=590 height=586 /></span>",
